    "brief": "Prebuilt sets of buttons for `GtkDialog`.",
    "file": "gtk/deprecated/gtkmessagedialog.h",
    "line": 49,
    "md": "Prebuilt sets of buttons for `GtkDialog`.\n\nIf none of these choices are appropriate, simply use\n%GTK_BUTTONS_NONE and call [`Dialog.add_buttons()`](xref:gtk:Gtk.Dialog#method:add_buttons).\n\n> Please note that %GTK_BUTTONS_OK, %GTK_BUTTONS_YES_NO\n> and %GTK_BUTTONS_OK_CANCEL are discouraged by the\n> [GNOME Human Interface Guidelines](https://developer.gnome.org/hig/)."
  },
